## HL7 v2.x Integration

### Supported Message Types

| Message | Purpose | Direction |
|---------|---------|-----------|
| ADT^A01 | Admit | Inbound |
| ADT^A02 | Transfer | Inbound |
| ADT^A03 | Discharge | Inbound |
| ADT^A04 | Register | Inbound |
| ADT^A08 | Update | Inbound |
| ORM^O01 | Order | Outbound |
| ORU^R01 | Results | Inbound |
| MDM^T02 | Document | Bi-directional |
| SIU^S12 | Schedule | Inbound |

### HL7 Configuration

**Connection Settings**:
```
Protocol: MLLP (TCP/IP)
Port: Customer-assigned
Encoding: UTF-8
ACK Mode: Enhanced
Retry: 3 attempts, exponential backoff
```

**Segment Requirements**:
- MSH: Message header with routing
- PID: Patient identification
- PV1: Patient visit information
- IN1: Insurance (if available)
- OBX: Observations (for results)

